Rust port of the isometric geometry in the anatomy kit.

Repository: https://github.com/wheresryan22/anatomy
Commit:     1482e84
Licence:    MIT, copied verbatim to LICENSE-anatomy in this directory

Ported from:
  kit/iso-kit.mjs   projection and depth, rounded plans, extrude and slab with
                    the four-tone shading and bevels, cylinders, circle rings,
                    on-top lines, radial and edge ticks, knurls, dot grids,
                    side seams and the painter rules that order them
  kit/iso.css       the light theme palette (values only, used by the sheet)

The camera, the shading buckets and the outline runs follow the kit's formulas.
The models under src/models are original. Their proportions follow the
assembler and crate references in the user's earlier explorations, and their
parts follow the craft recipes in the kit's references/craft.md.
